# Tailscale distsign root public keys, used by mise/tasks/tailscale-update to
# verify https://pkgs.tailscale.com/distsign.pub (the signing-key bundle).
#
# Copied verbatim from tailscale/tailscale clientupdate/distsign/roots/ at
# commit 37fc7a7a7260e7d8231c04a568db613b09e25d88 (2026-10-22):
#   distsign-prod-root-1-pub.pem, then crawshaw-root.pem.
# As of 2026-10-22 the bundle verifies against crawshaw-root, not prod-root-1.
#
# Each block is a raw 32-byte ed25519 public key, base64, under Tailscale's own
# PEM label (not SubjectPublicKeyInfo). Lines outside BEGIN/END are ignored.
#
# A verification failure against these keys means Tailscale rotated roots or
# something is wrong. Do NOT update this file from pkgs.tailscale.com: re-copy
# it from the upstream source tree in a reviewed PR and re-run
# `mise run tailscale-update --verify-current`.
-----BEGIN ROOT PUBLIC KEY-----
ZjjKhUHBtLNRSO1dhOTjrXJGJ8lDe1594WM2XDuheVQ=
-----END ROOT PUBLIC KEY-----
-----BEGIN ROOT PUBLIC KEY-----
Psrabv2YNiEDhPlnLVSMtB5EKACm7zxvKxfvYD4i7X8=
-----END ROOT PUBLIC KEY-----
